 v. State\">303 S. E. 2d 266</a></span>; No. 83-5145, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1647034\"><a href=\"/opinion/1647034/armstrong-v-state/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Armstrong v. State\">429 So. 2d 287</a></span>; No. 83-5183, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9600426\"><a href=\"/opinion/1359832/davis-v-state/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Davis v. State\">665 P. 2d 1186</a></span>; No. 83-5227, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9600498\"><a href=\"/opinion/1359976/state-v-adamson/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: State v. Adamson\">136 Ariz. 250</a></span>, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9600498\"><a href=\"/opinion/1359976/state-v-adamson/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: State v. Adamson\">665 P. 2d 972</a></span>.</p>\n</opinion>"},{"id":9281252,"type":"dissent","typeCode":"040dissent","perCuriam":false,"author":"Brennanmarshall","joinedBy":"","pageCount":null,"textLength":594,"isHtml":true,"text":"<opinion type=\"dissent\">\n<author id=\"b740-5\">Justice Brennan and Justice Marshall,</author>\n<p id=\"Axm\">dissenting.</p>\n<p id=\"b740-6\">Adhering to our views that the death penalty is in all circumstances cruel and unusual punishment prohibited by the Eighth and Fourteenth Amendments, <em>Gregg </em>v. <em>Georgia, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9426555\"><a href=\"/opinion/109532/gregg-v-georgia/#227\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Gregg v. Georgia\">428 U. S. 153, 227, 231</a></span> (1976), we would grant certiorari and vacate the death sentences in these cases.</p>\n</opinion>"}],"citations":[]}